config ALLOC
	bool "alloc: allocator interface and arenas"
	default y
	select STATUS
	help
	  The el_allocator interface, a bump arena and a stack arena over
	  caller-provided storage, and the contract test suite for
	  allocators. Freestanding: needs no runtime symbol.

config ALLOC_LIBC
	bool "alloc_libc: allocator over the C library heap"
	default y
	depends on ALLOC && PLATFORM_POSIX
	help
	  An el_allocator over malloc(), aligned_alloc(), and free(), for
	  programs with a hosted C library. Available where the POSIX probe
	  finds <unistd.h>, which stands in for "a hosted C library": Linux
	  is the only host operating system Elemental supports.
